{"3958880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rosemary Village", "steam_appid": 3958880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat, varied environments, optional activities and interesting characters are just a few examples of what you can expect from the game, as well as mechanics that will make you replay Rosemary Village over and over again...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dynamics of battles are largely defined by the balance between defense and attack, where it is necessary to go on the offensive to defeat the enemy, but it is also essential to know when to protect yourself. In Rosemary Village, one of the most important skills is &quot;Guard&quot;, as it grants the user a round of blocking and 1 HP healing, which is very important to the player's success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Rosemary Village, Slime Woods, Travelers' Camp, the Castle, Mines, and even an Igloo! More linear environments and stretches of more open scenery coexist in Rosemary Village, providing a good variety of locations and ways to explore each one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every save has to be identical! You can choose to help certain people, ignore their requests, or even pretend to help them, just to keep them waiting! (Yes, this is entirely possible).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet people with &quot;eccentric&quot; personalities throughout the game's world, where it might be interesting to hear  about their stories. Dialogue options are available, allowing the player to respond or ask questions in different ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a hidden place, a secret enemy, alternative cutscenes... obviously I'm not going to tell you how to do it, after all, it's a secret...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat, varied environments, optional activities and interesting characters are just a few examples of what you can expect from the game, as well as mechanics that will make you replay Rosemary Village over and over again...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dynamics of battles are largely defined by the balance between defense and attack, where it is necessary to go on the offensive to defeat the enemy, but it is also essential to know when to protect yourself. In Rosemary Village, one of the most important skills is &quot;Guard&quot;, as it grants the user a round of blocking and 1 HP healing, which is very important to the player's success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Rosemary Village, Slime Woods, Travelers' Camp, the Castle, Mines, and even an Igloo! More linear environments and stretches of more open scenery coexist in Rosemary Village, providing a good variety of locations and ways to explore each one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every save has to be identical! You can choose to help certain people, ignore their requests, or even pretend to help them, just to keep them waiting! (Yes, this is entirely possible).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet people with &quot;eccentric&quot; personalities throughout the game's world, where it might be interesting to hear  about their stories. Dialogue options are available, allowing the player to respond or ask questions in different ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a hidden place, a secret enemy, alternative cutscenes... obviously I'm not going to tell you how to do it, after all, it's a secret...</p>", "short_description": "Play as Ferdinand, a young adventurer in search of a new journey. In Rosemary Village, even the simplest adventure can put a lot at stake, and in it, Ferdinand's will and power will be his main weapons.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958880/9078ba3749eaa0eb6a7179ee7f363158145089af/header.jpg?t=1768496418", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958880/f8d461c4efd269c44e71299e71a022de2ddbd157/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768496418", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958880/f8d461c4efd269c44e71299e71a022de2ddbd157/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768496418", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP / Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Pentium® 4 2.0 GHz equivalent or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 190 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Pentium® 4 2.0 GHz equivalent or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM MB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["GamesReviewsStudios"], "publishers": ["GamesReviewsStudios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 199, "final": 199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$1.99"}, "packages": [1390332], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Rosemary Village", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1390332, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Rosemary Village - $1.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 199}]}], "platforms": {"wi